{"id":"f621b1eefe16c90e","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-cor-exponential-martingale.md","title":"Exponential Martingale","display":"cor-exponential-martingale — Exponential Martingale","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-exponential-martingale","aliases":["58-cor-exponential-martingale"],"display":"cor-exponential-martingale — Exponential Martingale","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-thm-levy-characterization.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-exponential-martingale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-exponential-martingale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-exponential-martingale — Exponential Martingale"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"beeff998335147f4\" href=\"?note=beeff998335147f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-thm-levy-characterization.md\">../batch04/58-thm-levy-characterization.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,q,E,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V\">\\(M,q,E,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S(q,M,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S(q,M,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\)</span> are the exact filtered-process predicates defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"beeff998335147f4\" href=\"?note=beeff998335147f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-thm-levy-characterization.md\">../batch04/58-thm-levy-characterization.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span> are the fully parameterized conditional expectation and expectation from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> is the typed function predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}exponential\\text{-}martingale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\n\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S(q,M,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land \\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:M(0)(\\omega)\\neq0\\})=0\n\\land\\forall T\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}\\!\\left[\\exp\\!\\left(\\tfrac12 q(T)\\right)\\right]&lt;\\infty\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R^{\\Omega})\n\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(E(t)=\\exp(M(t)-\\tfrac12q(t))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(s\\leq t\\to\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(E(s),E(t),\\mathcal F_s,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}exponential\\text{-}martingale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\n\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S(q,M,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land \\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:M(0)(\\omega)\\neq0\\})=0\n\\land\\forall T\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}\\!\\left[\\exp\\!\\left(\\tfrac12 q(T)\\right)\\right]&lt;\\infty\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R^{\\Omega})\n\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(E(t)=\\exp(M(t)-\\tfrac12q(t))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(s\\leq t\\to\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(E(s),E(t),\\mathcal F_s,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is Novikov's criterion for the Doléans exponential of a continuous local martingale.  Both process predicates now use the six-place signatures and argument order fixed by the cited Lévy-characterization atom.</li>\n<li>It satisfies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(0)=1\">\\(E(0)=1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-thm-levy-characterization.md","status":"resolved","id":"beeff998335147f4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-thm-levy-characterization.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-thm-levy-characterization.md","status":"resolved","id":"beeff998335147f4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)$ and $\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S(q,M,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)$ are the exact filtered-process predicates defined in [[../batch04/58-thm-levy-characterization.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CondExp}_S$ and $\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}$ are the fully parameterized conditional expectation and expectation from [[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ is the typed function predicate (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,q,E,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S(q,M,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CondExp}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}exponential\\text{-}martingale}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\n\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S(q,M,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land \\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:M(0)(\\omega)\\neq0\\})=0\n\\land\\forall T\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}\\!\\left[\\exp\\!\\left(\\tfrac12 q(T)\\right)\\right]<\\infty\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R^{\\Omega})\n\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(E(t)=\\exp(M(t)-\\tfrac12q(t))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{38mm}\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(s\\leq t\\to\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(E(s),E(t),\\mathcal F_s,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E(0)=1","display":false}],"bytes":2089,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-cor-exponential-martingale.md|58-cor-exponential-martingale]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["beeff998335147f4","2e4ee9615831113b","36d7463d215be751"]}